      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>, with the same face, hairstyle and clothing throughout. S1 uses only the vocal identity/timbre reference in <Audio 1>; the recording is not the target dialogue.\nsummary:\nOne continuous portrait shot with a fixed camera and steady soft studio lighting. A brief Mandarin exchange finishes in the opening four seconds. She then responds with a silent nod, a small wave and a gentle head turn. Keep the same background and framing throughout. No scene cut, subtitles, narration or improvised dialogue.\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet steady room tone throughout. Only the two quoted local Mandarin lines are spoken, once each. After she finishes them, only quiet room tone accompanies the specified silent gestures.",
        "During 00:00.000–00:02.000, S1 looks at the person beside the camera and calmly says once, at a natural conversational pace: <d>[Mandarin]你终于回来了。</d> She finishes the line within this interval.\nDuring 00:02.000–00:04.000, S1 softens her expression with relief and restrained joy, maintains eye contact and gently says once: <d>[Mandarin]这次别再走了。</d> She completes the line and closes her lips by the end of this interval.\nDuring 00:04.000–00:06.000, with her lips comfortably closed, S1 gives one small silent nod and raises her right hand to shoulder height for a brief restrained wave. Her expression is warm and relieved. Only quiet room tone; she is no longer speaking.\nDuring 00:06.000–00:08.000, S1 gently lowers her hand, turns her head a little toward the person beside the camera, and settles into a relaxed small smile with a natural blink. Keep her lips closed, the camera fixed and the lighting unchanged. This silent gesture and quiet room tone continue through any render padding; no further dialogue.",
        193,
        "frames",
        "0-47\n48-95\n96-143\n144-208",
        "paper_v1",
